#X text 628 144 This is mainly the same patch as I started with p78_activate_when_random_is_50.pd. I put in a creation argument for the volume control so that I do not have to change the horizontal slider. Is there a initial value for that? Time to check. The slider does have an option to have an init value. When activated \, the slider stays at whatever value it was when the patch was saved. The creation argument for the [*~] is not necessary in that case. With no init value option set \, that creation argument is helpful.;
